   "design": "The securing manuals and rule books are indexed by cargo type, so the inspector opens the right sections directly, instead of searching. Cargo weights and dimensions arrive as data with the shipment and load into a certified calculation that checks capacities and stability limits by fixed rules. Reading the plan, register lookups, the supervisor talk, inspecting securing points, colleagues and the note stay with the inspector. No model calculates stability.",
